{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127083032465-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127094945\"/><p>吐露港公路發生交通意外。</p><p>大埔發生交通意外。今晨(27日)8時13分，3輛私家車及1輛客貨車沿吐露港公路快線往九龍方向，至近元洲仔對開時，前方車輛懷疑因應路面交通情況收慢，尾隨車輛收掣不及撞上，造成4車「串燒」意外。意外中，3人受輕傷，清醒由救護車送院治理，意外原因有待調查。受事件影響，往九龍方向交通一度受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T02:03:57.622300+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T13:37:16.345718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T01:57:32.574962+00:00","content_hash":"d8781f743152775fd5eec9fb82f3ef8e2273ae1eb696ba36621cdb8aa1c70f04","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T02:03:57.622300+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}